  "Name": "XODA 0.4.5 Arbitrary PHP File Upload Vulnerability",
  "Description": "This module exploits a file upload vulnerability found in XODA 0.4.5. Attackers can abuse the \"upload\" command in order to upload a malicious PHP file without any authentication, which results in arbitrary code execution. The module has been tested successfully on XODA 0.4.5 and Ubuntu 10.04.",
